  "solution": "**Given:**\n\ntan A = (2)/(3)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\ntan A = (2)/(3)\n\n⇒ (sinA)/(cosA) = (2)/(3)\n\nSo, (5 sin2A - 2 cos2A) ÷ (15 sin2A + 3 cos2A) = (5 × 2² - 2 × 3²) ÷ (15 × 2² + 3 × 3²)\n\n⇒ (5 × 4 - 2 × 9) ÷ (15 × 4 + 3 × 9)\n\n⇒ (20 - 18) ÷ (60 + 27)\n\n⇒ 2 ÷ 87\n\n⇒ (2)/(87)\n\n**∴ The required answer is (2)/(87).**",
